  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "エクササイズ用の　大きなボール。うまく乗れば　体幹を　鍛えられる。飽きても　椅子として　使える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "큰 사이즈의 운동용 볼. 제대로 올라타면 코어 근육을 단련할 수 있다. 질리면 의자로 활용할 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "運動用的大球。穩坐在其上能鍛鍊到軀幹。即使覺得膩了，也能當椅子使用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un gros ballon conçu pour faire de l’exercice. Il peut aussi servir de chaise quand on fatigue.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein großer Ball für Gymnastikübungen. Er eignet sich außerdem als Sitzgelegenheit, wenn man eine Verschnaufpause braucht.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una pelota grande para hacer ejercicio. Si uno se cansa, se puede emplear a modo de silla.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Grossa palla per fare esercizio. Se ci si stufa, può comunque essere usata come sedia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A big ball designed for exercising. It can work as a seat if you get tired, too.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "エクササイズ用の　大きなボール。うまく乗れば　体幹を　鍛えられる。飽きても　椅子として　使える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "健身用的大球。若能漂亮地乘上去，便可以锻炼体干。当厌倦锻炼了，还能当椅子使用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
